# Kaggriculture AI Platform

This is a production-ready autonomous AI agent for the Kaggriculture Kaggle Competition.

## Overview

This platform provides a modular, extensible architecture for building competitive AI agents for Kaggriculture, starting with deterministic baseline strategies and enabling integration of advanced techniques (Monte Carlo Tree Search, Reinforcement Learning, Evolutionary Algorithms) without breaking compatibility.

